  <div class="facts3">
    <div><strong>Art. 51</strong><span>MedDO: CH-REP for medical devices</span></div>
    <div><strong>Art. 44</strong><span>IvDO: CH-REP for in vitro diagnostics</span></div>
    <div><strong>7 days</strong><span>to hand technical documentation to Swissmedic on request</span></div>
